WEBVTT

00:55.040 --> 00:55.774
(This drama is a work of fiction.)

00:55.774 --> 00:56.608
(All characters, organizations,
and events in this drama are fictitious.)

00:56.608 --> 00:57.409
(This drama complied
with production guidelines...)

00:57.409 --> 00:58.177
(for filming child actors and animals.)

01:05.117 --> 01:07.486
(Mono Group Chairman Choi Young Ho
shares warmth for the Korean New Year.)

01:07.486 --> 01:09.288
(Joins Hope 2025 Sharing Campaign
for sustainable CSR)

01:09.288 --> 01:11.723
(Visited a flophouse district
to volunteer and offer support)

01:14.226 --> 01:15.260
(Mono Group's major overseas projects
moving smoothly)

01:15.260 --> 01:16.195
(Record-breaking performance
expected this year)

01:17.162 --> 01:18.397
(Successful overseas expansion continues)

01:20.365 --> 01:21.633
(The hidden architect behind the veil)

01:21.633 --> 01:22.868
(Chairman Choi Young Ho's
suspicious master plan)

01:22.868 --> 01:24.002
(The illusion of delegated management,
Mono Group's dual structure)

01:27.139 --> 01:28.674
(The hidden architect behind the veil)

01:28.674 --> 01:30.242
(Chairman Choi Young Ho's
suspicious master plan)

01:31.844 --> 01:34.746
Choi Young Ho made a fortune
in overseas construction.

01:35.614 --> 01:37.916
Starting with nothing,
he's come this far...

01:38.317 --> 01:40.385
with almost no real enemies,

01:40.853 --> 01:43.155
which proves his business sense
and ability are exceptional.

01:50.762 --> 01:52.564
(Mono Group)

01:53.332 --> 01:55.033
It's the company he founded,

01:55.467 --> 01:58.437
but for the past few years, he's entrusted
management to Vice Chairman Yoo Min Ho,

01:59.204 --> 02:01.840
and is known to retain
only final decision-making authority.

02:03.108 --> 02:04.376
But many still believe...

02:04.376 --> 02:06.778
he continues to direct and decide
everything behind the scenes,

02:07.779 --> 02:09.615
so he's definitely a man
who is not what he appears to be.

02:09.615 --> 02:12.217
(Choi Hee Su's fiancé - Ryu Jun Ho)

02:18.090 --> 02:20.826
It feels like he's deliberately keeping
his domestic activities to a minimum...

02:21.527 --> 02:23.061
in several different ways.

02:24.496 --> 02:26.298
He's so shrouded in secrecy...

02:26.765 --> 02:28.600
and spends most of his time overseas...

02:29.201 --> 02:30.903
that getting close to him is impossible.

02:34.473 --> 02:37.576
I've heard people say
his plane is his office.

02:41.113 --> 02:43.482
(Kim Soo Yeon)

02:43.749 --> 02:44.750
Mom.

02:46.118 --> 02:48.287
Mom, I'm here.

02:48.287 --> 02:50.222
His wife passed away a few years ago.

02:51.056 --> 02:52.391
Since then,

02:52.391 --> 02:54.760
he's been spending far more time overseas.

02:55.761 --> 02:57.596
He has a daughter studying abroad,

02:58.564 --> 03:00.699
and she's probably around your age.

03:01.233 --> 03:03.936
Whatever it is,
if it comes out of that girl's mouth,

03:03.936 --> 03:05.671
you can assume anything is possible.

03:06.572 --> 03:08.240
She's his only blood relative,

03:08.240 --> 03:09.875
so apparently, he's very attached to her.

03:17.416 --> 03:18.383
This house?

03:19.751 --> 03:20.919
It was listed at five million dollars...

03:20.919 --> 03:22.120
Just like you said,

03:22.120 --> 03:23.789
that girl, Choi Hee Su,

03:24.256 --> 03:25.724
got a place in Hanyeon-dong.

03:26.692 --> 03:28.927
You'll need to find out
exactly where it is.

03:30.095 --> 03:31.063
Of course.

03:32.197 --> 03:33.198
She's lived abroad for a long time,

03:33.198 --> 03:34.967
so she likely doesn't know
many people in Korea.

03:36.201 --> 03:38.203
That means she'll spend
a lot of time at home.

03:43.041 --> 03:45.077
Choi Hee Su bought a building
worth over five million dollars...

03:45.077 --> 03:46.445
and uses it as a studio,

03:47.379 --> 03:49.915
but the neighbors say
they've barely even seen her face.

03:51.483 --> 03:52.851
She has a closed-off personality,

03:53.418 --> 03:55.120
so getting close to her won't be easy.

03:56.522 --> 03:58.824
It's clear she doesn't
trust people easily.

03:59.691 --> 04:01.260
She acts exactly like him.

04:01.894 --> 04:03.428
Like father, like daughter.

04:03.795 --> 04:06.899
(Atelier)

04:06.899 --> 04:09.735
(Inner Landscapes: The Flow of Emotion
Choi Hee Su Solo Exhibition)

04:20.846 --> 04:22.881
Which piece are you most attached to?

04:22.881 --> 04:26.151
This is my first solo exhibition in Korea,

04:26.151 --> 04:29.988
so I tried to put a bit of my emotions
into each piece.

04:29.988 --> 04:31.490
She majored in painting,

04:32.291 --> 04:34.326
and she's fairly well known
in the industry.

04:35.360 --> 04:36.929
Her skills are top-notch.

04:38.096 --> 04:40.132
She's not some rich girl...

04:41.200 --> 04:42.901
who lives off her family and does nothing.

04:45.804 --> 04:47.840
The only way to meet Choi Young Ho...

04:48.740 --> 04:51.276
is to approach this girl
and wait for an opening.

04:52.878 --> 04:55.113
I don't see any other way.

05:03.555 --> 05:05.624
This is where it gets difficult.

05:06.792 --> 05:08.727
Think carefully about how to approach her,

05:09.595 --> 05:11.463
then act with caution.

05:12.498 --> 05:14.366
There must be countless people
swarming around,

05:14.933 --> 05:16.969
looking for a way to get something...

05:16.969 --> 05:18.403
out of that rich man.

05:19.805 --> 05:22.574
The moment you look like one of them,
your chance is gone.

05:22.875 --> 05:23.742
Forever.

05:36.622 --> 05:38.123
Sorry, but let's finish the interview.

05:38.123 --> 05:39.658
Please take a good look around.

05:40.325 --> 05:41.460
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

06:19.064 --> 06:20.098
Hello.

06:23.702 --> 06:25.337
For a moment, I had this thought.

06:27.105 --> 06:28.207
Maybe my target...

06:28.207 --> 06:30.609
should include the daughter
Choi Young Ho treasures so much,

06:32.277 --> 06:34.079
Choi Hee Su too.

06:36.882 --> 06:39.618
He killed someone else's family
while protecting his own blood,

06:39.618 --> 06:42.354
so maybe that would be
a more fitting way...

06:43.021 --> 06:45.424
to take revenge on that shameless old man.

06:45.691 --> 06:47.326
Do you like the painting?

06:49.394 --> 06:51.163
That's when one idea came to me.

06:52.297 --> 06:53.599
- Thank you.
- Maybe,

06:55.167 --> 06:56.568
Choi Young Ho's end...

06:58.170 --> 07:00.072
will be crueler than I expected.

07:02.808 --> 07:05.344
Because there's no such thing
as revenge that only gives back...

07:07.312 --> 07:08.347
what was done to you.

07:11.650 --> 07:15.020
(Revenge)

07:27.866 --> 07:29.535
Come here, honey.

07:30.969 --> 07:32.671
I'm home.

07:33.672 --> 07:35.707
Why do you look so down?

07:36.141 --> 07:37.209
Did something happen?

07:37.509 --> 07:39.244
- No, nothing.
- Really?

07:40.812 --> 07:41.880
Ms. Ham Myo Jin.

07:42.447 --> 07:43.515
You have a package.

07:55.060 --> 07:57.396
Here's your package.

07:59.464 --> 08:00.299
Thanks.

08:15.781 --> 08:16.615
What?

08:20.786 --> 08:21.620
No way.

08:23.522 --> 08:24.356
This...

08:26.225 --> 08:27.092
Dad.

08:27.693 --> 08:28.894
You'll get hurt, careful.

08:29.761 --> 08:32.364
Dad, I wanted this so badly.

08:32.364 --> 08:33.532
Do you think your dad
or mom wouldn't know...

08:33.532 --> 08:35.834
what you want?

08:35.834 --> 08:38.670
I'm going to draw so well with this.

08:38.670 --> 08:39.738
All right.

08:39.738 --> 08:42.207
- My pretty girl.
- I love it.

08:58.190 --> 09:01.360
(Cheongham Flower Farm)

09:03.929 --> 09:04.763
There.

09:05.631 --> 09:06.465
Mom.

09:07.833 --> 09:09.234
That's pretty.

09:09.801 --> 09:10.903
Three flowers?

09:11.403 --> 09:12.504
Is that our family?

09:12.504 --> 09:13.338
Yes.

09:14.940 --> 09:17.743
Who did you get those crafty hands from?

09:20.612 --> 09:21.446
Myo Jin.

09:22.080 --> 09:24.016
- I'm going fishing.
- What?

09:24.650 --> 09:25.817
Wait for me!

09:27.186 --> 09:29.154
Hey, you'll fall.

09:29.154 --> 09:30.389
Be careful.

09:35.394 --> 09:36.628
Goodness.

10:35.621 --> 10:37.623
I never imagined...

10:39.658 --> 10:41.059
this was how you and I would end.

10:41.059 --> 10:41.994
Shut up.

10:43.795 --> 10:45.364
Even if you went back a hundred times,

10:46.331 --> 10:49.001
you'd do the same thing.
That's who you are.

15:01.453 --> 15:02.454
Please.

15:03.222 --> 15:04.823
Please!

15:11.630 --> 15:13.365
Even after your memories came back,

15:14.233 --> 15:16.201
even after you learned everything,

15:17.903 --> 15:18.804
please,

15:19.471 --> 15:21.039
if you had just pretended not to know,

15:24.142 --> 15:25.978
we could've been happy.

15:26.278 --> 15:27.713
Shut up, you evil bastard.

15:36.822 --> 15:38.390
Over one stupid memory?

15:39.358 --> 15:41.660
It's already over and gone.

15:43.762 --> 15:46.031
You're the one trapped in old memories.

15:48.433 --> 15:50.402
You're the one who can't get out.

15:53.705 --> 15:54.640
I'll kill you.

15:55.874 --> 15:56.675
Yes.

15:57.843 --> 15:58.744
Yes.

16:01.180 --> 16:02.915
I wish that too.

16:05.651 --> 16:06.585
I wish...

16:11.290 --> 16:12.191
someone...

16:13.859 --> 16:15.027
would stop me.

16:22.501 --> 16:23.402
Yes.

16:25.838 --> 16:27.105
Let's go together.

16:32.044 --> 16:33.178
Ryu Jun Ho, stop.

16:33.178 --> 16:34.046
Now.

16:37.683 --> 16:38.617
Let go of her.

16:49.628 --> 16:50.562
Damn it.

17:02.007 --> 17:03.141
Ms. Ham.

17:03.141 --> 17:04.476
Ms. Ham, wake up.

17:12.518 --> 17:13.485
Please wake up.

17:18.657 --> 17:20.125
I'm home.

17:20.125 --> 17:22.661
Honey, how was school?

17:22.661 --> 17:24.930
I bought snacks.

17:24.930 --> 17:25.731
Wait.

17:26.498 --> 17:27.499
Dad, what happened to your arm?

17:27.499 --> 17:30.369
This, well...

17:30.369 --> 17:31.436
- Right.
- Yeah?

17:31.837 --> 17:34.273
Did you tell your art club friends
to come over?

17:34.773 --> 17:37.509
I'll buy something tasty,
so bring everyone.

17:37.509 --> 17:40.112
You can all draw on that computer
and have fun.

17:41.213 --> 17:42.681
No, it's embarrassing.

17:43.649 --> 17:44.850
Embarrassing?

17:46.685 --> 17:48.320
I'm the only one without my own room.

17:48.320 --> 17:49.688
I don't want to invite my friends.

17:50.589 --> 17:51.857
I see.

17:54.259 --> 17:56.361
But Dad, how did you hurt your arm?

17:57.362 --> 17:58.430
This?

17:59.698 --> 18:02.434
Earlier,

18:02.434 --> 18:04.403
- I was working in the field and...
- Yeah?

18:15.280 --> 18:17.850
When the kids see our place,
they'll think it's kind of shabby, right?

18:17.850 --> 18:21.386
I told you not to keep telling her
to bring friends over.

18:21.386 --> 18:22.788
You're so clueless.

18:26.058 --> 18:26.925
Well,

18:29.495 --> 18:31.063
Myo Jin does need...

18:32.331 --> 18:34.199
her own room now.

18:36.502 --> 18:38.237
Of course, she does.

18:40.105 --> 18:43.342
Our daughter is a grown young lady now.

18:46.678 --> 18:47.746
With our situation,

18:49.681 --> 18:53.118
when could we ever find a place
with a proper room?

18:56.555 --> 18:58.123
Just wait and see.

18:58.123 --> 18:59.057
This time,

18:59.992 --> 19:02.628
who knows if we might get picked
for public housing?

19:04.763 --> 19:06.632
If we didn't get it last year,

19:07.599 --> 19:09.101
why would we get it this year?

19:10.903 --> 19:13.005
You and your bad luck.

19:14.239 --> 19:16.775
We need to give Myo Jin her own room.

19:20.279 --> 19:21.280
Still,

19:21.847 --> 19:24.483
Myo Jin is so bright.

19:27.719 --> 19:29.488
That puts my mind at ease.

19:29.855 --> 19:31.023
Goodness.

19:32.024 --> 19:33.826
Do you think she isn't hurting inside?

19:36.128 --> 19:37.763
She just doesn't say it.

19:40.933 --> 19:42.501
Do you think I don't know...

19:45.003 --> 19:46.872
how deep-hearted Myo Jin is?

19:51.543 --> 19:54.079
You have to leave for work at dawn.
Go to sleep.

20:38.624 --> 20:39.992
I don't need anything else.

20:41.093 --> 20:42.227
Just tell me this.

20:43.795 --> 20:45.731
Did you kill my mom and dad?

20:48.333 --> 20:49.334
Myo Jin!

20:51.703 --> 20:53.138
Do you miss your parents?

20:54.373 --> 20:56.275
Will you only be satisfied
after seeing blood?

20:56.742 --> 20:58.143
If you want revenge,

20:58.577 --> 21:00.579
get your head on straight first.

21:01.013 --> 21:02.981
Do whatever it takes
to recover your memories.

21:03.649 --> 21:05.350
The things I told you.

21:05.951 --> 21:07.819
No matter how bad the accident was,

21:08.420 --> 21:09.288
they're not something...

21:09.988 --> 21:11.957
you can just forget.

21:11.957 --> 21:13.525
I tried hundreds of times,

21:13.926 --> 21:15.394
but nothing worked.

21:16.929 --> 21:19.331
Coming to you was
the last thing I could do.

21:19.331 --> 21:21.466
It isn't true that I confessed
to the police...

21:21.466 --> 21:23.468
I set the fire by mistake.

21:24.570 --> 21:26.805
The truth I hid
even when I went to prison...

21:27.506 --> 21:30.309
and told only you.

21:31.076 --> 21:32.845
You still don't remember it?

21:34.146 --> 21:35.147
None of it?

21:36.415 --> 21:37.349
Tell me...

21:38.517 --> 21:39.751
what happened.

21:42.087 --> 21:44.423
Who killed my mom and dad, and why?

21:57.936 --> 22:01.006
This cancer is eating my body away.

22:12.551 --> 22:14.453
I don't know what'll happen or when.

22:15.487 --> 22:16.555
So I kept something.

22:26.798 --> 22:28.534
I told you...

22:30.502 --> 22:32.804
the first time you came
saying you'd kill me.

22:33.438 --> 22:34.540
A guy like me...

22:35.774 --> 22:37.242
doesn't trust the world.

22:39.478 --> 22:41.613
What you can trust isn't people or money.

22:43.715 --> 22:45.817
It's the insurance you keep on them.

22:47.085 --> 22:48.086
Lee Jong Su.

22:49.488 --> 22:51.924
He's the guy who brought
Chairman Choi Young Ho's money.

22:53.192 --> 22:55.194
I recorded my conversation with him.

22:55.727 --> 22:57.262
There will come a time when you need it.

22:57.896 --> 22:58.964
Then this is...

22:59.932 --> 23:00.866
Listen to it.

23:01.800 --> 23:04.303
You won't have anything left
to wonder about.

23:08.740 --> 23:09.675
Now go.

23:11.276 --> 23:12.845
And don't ever come back.

23:18.383 --> 23:19.751
I won't be here even if you do.

24:08.867 --> 24:09.768
Seriously?

24:10.569 --> 24:14.106
They make me do
all kinds of ridiculous crap.

24:17.075 --> 24:18.010
This is it.

24:30.589 --> 24:32.691
Are you on your way back
from the hospital?

24:34.827 --> 24:36.628
I cleaned this morning.

24:36.628 --> 24:38.630
I just did this
while I was cleaning the second floor.

24:38.630 --> 24:40.232
By the way, what did the hospital say?

24:41.333 --> 24:43.535
They said I'm recovering
faster than expected...

24:43.535 --> 24:45.437
and told me to take
even better care of myself.

24:45.437 --> 24:47.639
See? What did I tell you?

24:47.639 --> 24:49.942
If you do what I say,
you'll get better in no time.

24:50.442 --> 24:51.343
I'm happy for you.

25:12.130 --> 25:15.000
(Atibam)

25:47.432 --> 25:48.700
Good morning.

25:52.571 --> 25:54.806
Is there any place in particular
that feels uncomfortable?

25:55.908 --> 25:57.242
No, I'm fine.

25:58.377 --> 26:01.180
Your test results are all normal.

26:01.547 --> 26:02.447
That's a relief.

26:02.915 --> 26:05.083
The anesthetic that paralyzed your body...

26:05.083 --> 26:06.885
has been completely cleared.

26:07.186 --> 26:09.221
You're healthy enough...

26:09.221 --> 26:10.189
to be discharged today.

26:11.056 --> 26:12.090
Thank you.

26:15.093 --> 26:15.994
Doctor.

26:17.896 --> 26:20.465
Can I ask what happened to Ryu Jun Ho?

26:22.768 --> 26:25.370
You mean the suspect
with the gunshot wound?

26:26.538 --> 26:27.372
Yes.

26:27.940 --> 26:31.009
I heard his injuries are serious,
so he's in the ICU.

26:33.312 --> 26:34.980
If he's in the ICU,

26:36.048 --> 26:37.983
does that mean his life isn't in danger?

26:38.317 --> 26:39.651
Yes, that's right.

26:40.419 --> 26:42.321
Even if someone is a major criminal,

26:42.321 --> 26:43.755
in cases like this,

26:43.755 --> 26:44.857
for the sake of the investigation,

26:44.857 --> 26:46.892
they usually do everything they can
to keep them alive.

26:48.026 --> 26:49.328
Is he in this hospital?

26:50.229 --> 26:51.096
No.

26:51.463 --> 26:52.664
Since he's a murder suspect,

26:52.664 --> 26:54.433
he's under separate protection.

26:55.133 --> 26:57.336
He's under special police supervision,

26:57.336 --> 26:59.805
so even we don't know where he is.

27:00.639 --> 27:02.007
I see.

27:03.642 --> 27:04.409
Take care.

27:14.586 --> 27:18.790
(Seoul Namyeong Police Station)

27:19.091 --> 27:20.459
It seems Ryu Jun Ho...

27:20.459 --> 27:23.495
planned to make it look as though you,

27:23.495 --> 27:25.764
after killing Choi Young Ho
and Choi Hee Su to avenge your parents,

27:26.665 --> 27:29.334
also killed Wang Gi Cheol,

27:29.334 --> 27:31.103
who was paid to give
false testimony for them,

27:31.103 --> 27:34.072
and then staged everything
as an impulsive suicide...

27:34.072 --> 27:36.642
caused by traumatic brain injury.

27:37.342 --> 27:40.445
Even though he knew you were recovering,

27:40.946 --> 27:43.282
he kept making you take
medication for schizophrenia,

27:43.649 --> 27:45.717
deleted the recordings...

27:45.717 --> 27:48.053
that could have exposed his past actions,

27:48.453 --> 27:49.822
and they were all part
of the same pattern.

27:52.958 --> 27:54.393
On the day of the incident,

27:54.960 --> 27:56.461
the secretary, Director Kim Won Il,

27:56.895 --> 27:59.665
used a forged passport
and attended the conference in Germany...

27:59.665 --> 28:01.733
in Ryu Jun Ho's place.

28:02.134 --> 28:04.336
But when we actually began
tracing his accounts,

28:04.803 --> 28:06.171
he confessed to everything.

28:09.141 --> 28:10.609
How are you feeling, Ms. Ham?

28:13.745 --> 28:16.048
Thanks to you, I'm much better, Detective.

28:16.048 --> 28:17.549
I don't have to go
to the hospital anymore, either.

28:18.584 --> 28:19.751
That's really good to hear.

28:20.352 --> 28:22.921
What happens from here?

28:24.156 --> 28:25.290
In about two weeks,

28:25.290 --> 28:27.793
the full investigation will begin.

28:27.793 --> 28:30.295
In the end,
it'll become a battle over sentencing.

28:32.030 --> 28:32.931
I see.

28:33.532 --> 28:36.134
Ryu Jun Ho is currently
exercising his right to remain silent,

28:36.134 --> 28:38.704
so we still haven't heard directly...

28:38.704 --> 28:40.706
why he tried to kill you, Ms. Ham.

28:41.974 --> 28:42.875
Detective.

28:44.142 --> 28:46.144
If Ryu Jun Ho is staying silent...

28:47.779 --> 28:49.381
What you're assuming is right.

28:49.882 --> 28:51.517
The country's top law firm
is representing him.

28:52.518 --> 28:54.319
He's rich,

28:54.319 --> 28:56.522
so he's put together
an extremely high-end defense team.

28:59.525 --> 29:00.626
Now,

29:00.626 --> 29:03.428
has your suspicion about Ms. Ham's
Jebu-do Island accident...

29:03.428 --> 29:04.963
been cleared up, Detective Woo?

29:04.963 --> 29:06.431
Of course.

29:07.065 --> 29:08.634
I've been very rude all this time.

29:11.637 --> 29:14.006
She went all the way to the villa
to save Choi Hee Su...

29:14.773 --> 29:16.308
and nearly lost her life.

29:16.909 --> 29:19.011
The shock of that moment
and the accident...

29:19.645 --> 29:21.847
are what have tormented Ms. Ham until now.

29:22.080 --> 29:23.549
I'm glad the misunderstanding
has been cleared up.

29:25.284 --> 29:26.685
I have a favor to ask.

29:28.787 --> 29:31.023
Please let me see Ryu Jun Ho
one last time.

29:39.097 --> 29:40.732
I want to return it to him myself.

29:43.569 --> 29:45.270
Yes, of course.

29:46.138 --> 29:47.139
Thank you.

29:59.551 --> 30:00.652
Questioning as a witness?

30:00.652 --> 30:01.720
What bullshit.

30:02.421 --> 30:03.755
I wasn't born yesterday.

30:04.389 --> 30:06.792
It's all because of that idiot.

30:07.426 --> 30:09.528
I'll never work with
brainless bastards again.

30:10.062 --> 30:10.996
Damn it.

30:17.803 --> 30:19.304
I'm sorry! Are you hurt?

30:21.373 --> 30:22.241
No.

30:23.208 --> 30:24.209
Are you Korean?

30:24.810 --> 30:26.512
Do you speak Korean?

30:26.979 --> 30:28.947
Well, I'm an overseas Chinese.

30:29.348 --> 30:30.449
But are you okay?

30:30.449 --> 30:31.316
Are you hurt?

30:31.316 --> 30:32.184
I'm sorry.

30:32.551 --> 30:33.652
I'm okay.

30:35.153 --> 30:36.688
I missed my flight last week,

30:36.688 --> 30:38.724
so I was rushing a little today
and caused this accident.

30:41.593 --> 30:43.729
I wish there were
more flights to Hong Kong.

30:43.996 --> 30:44.930
Are you going to Hong Kong?

30:45.764 --> 30:47.099
Same as me.

30:47.099 --> 30:48.500
- Really?
- Yes.

30:48.901 --> 30:51.270
I go every week for work.

30:53.405 --> 30:54.506
But the time...

30:56.942 --> 30:58.744
Would you like to talk
while we go together?

30:59.077 --> 31:00.012
Sure.

31:01.213 --> 31:02.147
Let's go.

31:02.147 --> 31:03.015
Thanks.

31:35.981 --> 31:37.816
(Restricted Area)

31:44.656 --> 31:46.692
I did receive Detective Woo's call,

31:47.326 --> 31:48.393
but because of the patient's condition,

31:48.961 --> 31:50.462
I can't give you much time.

31:51.697 --> 31:52.798
Yes, I understand.

31:53.699 --> 31:55.267
When you're finished,

31:55.267 --> 31:56.502
press this button.

31:57.836 --> 31:59.771
Then a nurse will come and escort you out.

32:01.473 --> 32:04.176
Can he hear my voice?

32:05.043 --> 32:05.811
Yes.

32:07.012 --> 32:07.846
Mr. Ryu.

32:08.480 --> 32:09.815
Ms. Ham is here.

32:55.294 --> 32:56.762
I was afraid.

33:03.669 --> 33:06.171
If your memories came back,

33:08.373 --> 33:10.142
you'd learn everything,

33:14.146 --> 33:16.515
and you'd leave me.

33:21.286 --> 33:22.588
Then I'd go back...

33:24.723 --> 33:26.658
to the past again.

33:43.108 --> 33:44.376
For one brief moment,

33:48.614 --> 33:49.615
there was a time...

33:51.250 --> 33:53.418
when I doubted you.

34:09.434 --> 34:10.836
(Voice Mail)

34:10.836 --> 34:12.337
(You have a new voice message.)

34:14.373 --> 34:15.307
Jun Ho.

34:15.807 --> 34:18.076
Your phone is off,
so I'll leave a voice message.

34:19.311 --> 34:20.379
Tonight,

34:21.213 --> 34:22.881
I don't think I can meet you.

34:29.588 --> 34:31.390
I should have stopped then.

34:37.029 --> 34:38.831
It was the last chance...

34:41.934 --> 34:43.202
to get away from you,

34:46.872 --> 34:48.307
but I threw it away.

34:51.510 --> 34:52.377
That's right.

34:58.317 --> 35:00.185
Every choice was yours.

35:05.390 --> 35:08.126
You must have hoped
my memories would never return.

35:10.229 --> 35:11.497
Because you wanted me
to forget everything...

35:12.998 --> 35:15.868
and live inside the cage you built for us.

35:16.768 --> 35:19.404
(Change of Address Form, Ham Myo Jin)

35:22.808 --> 35:24.209
Here you go.

35:24.510 --> 35:25.878
Yes, that's all set.

35:30.582 --> 35:31.550
This is him.

35:33.185 --> 35:33.986
Okay.

35:50.636 --> 35:51.470
What?

35:56.175 --> 35:58.944
But my feelings remembered you,

36:00.746 --> 36:02.781
and they showed me what I had to do.

36:08.187 --> 36:09.955
I came to say thank you.

36:11.790 --> 36:13.892
After the accident,
if it hadn't been for you,

36:15.994 --> 36:18.063
none of this would have been possible.

36:30.876 --> 36:32.211
The police said...

36:35.514 --> 36:37.516
I killed...

36:41.453 --> 36:42.387
Hee Su.

36:43.021 --> 36:45.324
What do they mean, I killed her?

36:46.859 --> 36:47.693
That day,

36:52.898 --> 36:56.702
I did try to kill those two,

36:58.971 --> 37:00.038
but I didn't...

37:03.742 --> 37:04.643
think of...

37:05.410 --> 37:06.411
doing so brutally.

37:08.180 --> 37:09.348
At least,

37:13.085 --> 37:14.186
I never...

37:17.356 --> 37:19.124
thought of doing it that way.

37:32.070 --> 37:32.938
Was it...

37:38.110 --> 37:39.411
you?

37:41.180 --> 37:42.314
Don't be curious.

37:44.249 --> 37:46.518
It's meaningless to you now anyway.

37:47.286 --> 37:48.253
Were...

37:52.191 --> 37:54.393
all the moments you spent with me...

37:56.161 --> 37:56.995
really...

38:01.300 --> 38:04.036
all lies?

38:06.071 --> 38:08.040
I'm surprised...

38:08.941 --> 38:09.975
you still wonder that.

38:17.850 --> 38:18.917
Why...

38:22.654 --> 38:24.623
be that cruel?

38:26.225 --> 38:27.092
Because that day,

38:29.895 --> 38:32.431
you were the one who set fire to my house.

38:34.700 --> 38:35.634
Because you...

38:36.502 --> 38:38.971
are the murderer
who killed my mom and dad.

38:56.288 --> 38:58.090
You'd better brace yourself.

39:07.032 --> 39:09.468
Until your whole body rots away,

39:10.802 --> 39:12.070
slowly, step by step,

39:13.539 --> 39:15.040
I'm going to break you down.

39:17.910 --> 39:18.944
Please...

39:21.980 --> 39:23.048
die slowly.

39:45.204 --> 39:47.472
(No Unauthorized Entry)

41:29.074 --> 41:30.642
(The late Ham Jun Seong, Lee Yoo Jeong,
2010.03.16)

41:30.642 --> 41:31.810
(Mom, Dad, rest in peace.)

41:32.244 --> 41:33.245
Dad.

41:35.714 --> 41:36.615
Mom.

41:39.218 --> 41:40.252
I'm here.

41:42.287 --> 41:43.555
I'm sorry...

41:46.892 --> 41:47.826
I came so late.

42:11.049 --> 42:12.084
Welcome.

42:14.686 --> 42:15.854
It's been a while.

42:21.493 --> 42:23.595
One pour-over coffee, please.

42:25.597 --> 42:26.765
It's all right.

42:27.266 --> 42:29.868
I'm curious to taste the coffee
you make yourself, Ms. Ham.

43:11.877 --> 43:12.845
It's good.

43:14.880 --> 43:16.315
It feels perfect.

43:24.056 --> 43:25.090
Last week,

43:25.724 --> 43:27.893
the police came
as part of the investigation.

43:28.760 --> 43:30.762
I heard about your parents, Ms. Ham,

43:31.430 --> 43:33.432
and looked up the articles
from back then too.

43:34.500 --> 43:37.870
The reactions you showed
during the initial tests...

43:38.337 --> 43:40.906
seemed like unrelated answers every time,

43:41.607 --> 43:44.176
but when I analyzed them again,
that wasn't the case.

43:50.883 --> 43:52.784
A thought suddenly occurred to me.

43:54.152 --> 43:55.787
Maybe everyone, myself included,

43:55.787 --> 43:57.956
was completely fooled.

43:58.490 --> 44:00.425
Choi Hee Su, Ryu Jun Ho,

44:00.425 --> 44:02.761
Chairman Choi Young Ho and Wang Gi Cheol.

44:03.362 --> 44:06.865
Everyone who brought tragedy
to your family is dead,

44:07.866 --> 44:09.201
and that can't be a coincidence.

44:13.972 --> 44:16.108
Is that how I look to you, Doctor?

44:16.808 --> 44:18.677
I didn't come here with any other reason.

44:19.344 --> 44:20.546
As a doctor,

44:20.546 --> 44:22.681
I was left with one unanswered question.

44:25.584 --> 44:26.852
When did it start?

44:27.819 --> 44:30.122
When did you begin hiding
that your memories had returned?

44:31.456 --> 44:33.225
Even if I told you,

44:33.992 --> 44:35.427
it wouldn't matter anymore.

44:36.662 --> 44:37.529
Why not?

44:40.098 --> 44:41.366
Because memories...

44:42.201 --> 44:43.435
belong to the past,

44:46.972 --> 44:48.941
and the past can't be undone.

44:51.176 --> 44:52.344
I told you.

44:52.578 --> 44:55.247
Back then, we got acceptance letters
from the best universities in America.

44:55.247 --> 44:56.114
Can that...

44:58.016 --> 45:00.185
be a reason to kill people?

45:05.157 --> 45:07.059
People with nothing to lose...

45:07.926 --> 45:10.429
all think like you, of course.

45:11.830 --> 45:12.664
What?

45:14.766 --> 45:15.601
You.

45:16.134 --> 45:18.370
When you first came to my exhibition
and saw my paintings, you cried.

45:19.304 --> 45:20.372
You said it yourself...

45:21.240 --> 45:23.041
that you could feel
my sorrow inside my paintings.

45:23.408 --> 45:24.343
My passion,

45:24.977 --> 45:27.179
my talent, all of it, so vividly.

45:27.813 --> 45:29.748
You said that you'd never felt
anything like it before.

45:31.250 --> 45:32.417
You're insane.

45:33.785 --> 45:36.121
If those people had ruined me back then,

45:42.427 --> 45:43.495
my paintings...

45:45.764 --> 45:47.332
wouldn't exist in the world now.

45:51.403 --> 45:52.771
Can you even imagine that?

46:03.448 --> 46:04.349
Hey.

46:04.616 --> 46:07.319
Do you know
what people with nothing to lose...

46:08.887 --> 46:10.689
are capable of?

46:14.860 --> 46:15.994
They just wait for their chance.

46:16.862 --> 46:19.464
They wait to find fault
with people who have money,

46:19.832 --> 46:21.733
and when they get the chance,
they pounce and rip them apart.

46:21.733 --> 46:22.568
Like animals.

46:23.569 --> 46:25.370
That's what happened to us that day.

46:26.271 --> 46:28.407
There is no one in this world
who has nothing to lose.

46:29.341 --> 46:31.743
Because those people were
someone's father and someone's mother too.

46:31.743 --> 46:33.512
Stop with the pathetic sob story.

46:35.380 --> 46:37.349
Who do you think you are
to talk to me like that?

46:37.349 --> 46:38.750
Are you saying I should've been ruined...

46:38.750 --> 46:40.886
because of people like them?

46:41.320 --> 46:42.120
I...

46:42.521 --> 46:44.323
am not like those people.

46:45.023 --> 46:47.459
I'm not one of those beastly types
who swarm like dogs...

46:47.459 --> 46:49.695
at the slightest opening
just to squeeze money out of people.

47:39.511 --> 47:40.345
This is insane.

47:41.547 --> 47:42.614
They're all insane.

48:09.208 --> 48:11.243
Why is it so noisy?

48:33.198 --> 48:34.032
Hee Su.

48:34.366 --> 48:35.267
Hee Su.

49:35.961 --> 49:37.963
Suspected traffic accident patient.

49:37.963 --> 49:40.132
Blood pressure 90 over 60.

49:40.432 --> 49:41.767
Ryu Jun Ho...

49:41.767 --> 49:43.502
Suspected thoracoabdominal trauma
and femur fracture.

49:43.502 --> 49:46.471
- killed...
- Requesting trauma team standby.

49:46.872 --> 49:49.842
- my mom and dad.
- Copy. The trauma team will stand by.

49:49.842 --> 49:50.943
I mustn't...

49:51.910 --> 49:53.512
- forget.
- Patient is being transported.

49:53.512 --> 49:55.013
The patient is unresponsive.

49:55.013 --> 49:56.348
That man...

49:58.617 --> 49:59.618
killed...

50:00.719 --> 50:02.087
my mom and...

50:02.087 --> 50:03.455
Check the bleeding sites again.

50:04.590 --> 50:06.959
(Rescue Team)

50:12.498 --> 50:13.332
Emergency patient.

50:13.332 --> 50:15.067
She was conscious at the scene,

50:15.067 --> 50:16.802
but lost consciousness again
during transport.

50:16.802 --> 50:18.270
Move her to the OR quickly.

50:18.270 --> 50:19.838
- Call a surgeon.
- Yes.

50:19.838 --> 50:20.973
(Central Surgery Center)

50:28.914 --> 50:29.781
Ma'am.

50:30.015 --> 50:31.116
Can you hear me?

50:31.416 --> 50:32.584
Can you hear me?

50:40.492 --> 50:41.260
Yes?

50:43.162 --> 50:44.096
What did you say?

50:44.997 --> 50:45.998
When I wake up,

50:46.798 --> 50:48.066
tell me...

50:52.271 --> 50:53.372
that Ryu Jun Ho...

50:55.374 --> 50:57.042
killed...

50:58.610 --> 50:59.711
my mom and dad.

51:02.915 --> 51:05.517
I must never forget.

51:10.389 --> 51:11.223
I must...

51:12.858 --> 51:14.726
remember.

51:16.962 --> 51:17.830
Ryu...

51:18.297 --> 51:19.264
Jun...

51:20.465 --> 51:21.400
Ho...

51:42.287 --> 51:43.222
Myo Jin.

51:43.555 --> 51:44.823
Please wake up.

51:48.427 --> 51:49.461
Are you coming around?

51:52.097 --> 51:53.966
Jun Ho.

51:55.334 --> 51:56.168
What?

51:57.302 --> 51:58.337
Ryu...

52:00.672 --> 52:01.974
Jun Ho.

52:02.708 --> 52:03.675
Yes, that's right.

52:05.477 --> 52:06.378
It's me.

52:07.179 --> 52:08.480
Ryu Jun Ho.

52:16.822 --> 52:17.756
Myo Jin.

52:32.571 --> 52:33.472
I...

52:35.140 --> 52:36.175
told you, didn't I?

52:38.410 --> 52:39.444
When you...

52:40.979 --> 52:42.948
first woke up after the accident,

52:46.785 --> 52:48.020
you didn't remember your own name,

52:50.255 --> 52:51.390
your family's names,

52:55.060 --> 52:56.195
or anything at all.

52:57.162 --> 52:58.897
Nothing at all.

53:01.266 --> 53:03.101
But...

53:05.404 --> 53:06.672
you only remembered...

53:08.907 --> 53:10.242
my name.

53:44.710 --> 53:46.445
You can forget everything else.

53:48.881 --> 53:49.781
Just keep...

53:51.250 --> 53:52.284
remembering...

53:56.588 --> 53:57.489
only me,

53:58.724 --> 54:00.159
like you do now.

54:06.064 --> 54:07.032
Forever.

54:25.751 --> 54:27.653
Have you ever felt truly terrified?

54:30.756 --> 54:33.292
That fear that everything
could collapse in an instant,

54:36.328 --> 54:39.965
and someone might make
your life turn out that way.

54:42.134 --> 54:45.304
You have a capable father
and someone you love.

54:46.805 --> 54:47.906
What are you afraid of?

54:52.411 --> 54:56.248
Everyone has at least one secret
they can't tell anyone.

54:59.117 --> 54:59.952
Mine...

55:00.986 --> 55:03.522
came too early.

55:05.424 --> 55:06.291
A secret?

55:07.125 --> 55:07.960
Yes.

55:08.527 --> 55:09.394
A secret...

55:12.231 --> 55:15.033
preserved like a specimen
until the day I die,

55:16.134 --> 55:17.503
following me everywhere.

55:22.107 --> 55:23.809
What kind of secret stays hidden forever?

55:30.682 --> 55:31.583
Is that so?

55:35.354 --> 55:38.490
Someone might already know it.

55:44.263 --> 55:45.397
You have...

55:47.166 --> 55:48.033
a secret too.

55:49.234 --> 55:50.068
What?

55:53.705 --> 55:54.573
I,

55:56.942 --> 55:58.010
sometimes,

55:59.611 --> 56:02.047
want to let everything go.

56:05.751 --> 56:07.286
I'm so tired.

56:12.291 --> 56:13.425
It's too hard.

56:19.298 --> 56:20.199
Myo Jin.

56:22.034 --> 56:23.902
Have you ever received a present?

56:46.124 --> 56:46.959
Myo Jin.

56:47.659 --> 56:49.695
Please put that away for me.

56:51.296 --> 56:52.698
That's...

56:52.698 --> 56:55.467
because the chairman and Ms. Choi
have this condition.

56:56.134 --> 56:58.270
They can't look at anything sharp.

57:01.974 --> 57:02.875
A present?

57:03.642 --> 57:05.010
Yes, a present.

57:08.747 --> 57:09.615
I don't know.

57:10.616 --> 57:13.352
I've never lived thinking
about things like that.

57:20.726 --> 57:21.894
Then should I give...

57:23.095 --> 57:23.996
that present to you?

57:24.730 --> 57:25.731
You? To me?

57:26.598 --> 57:27.432
Why?

57:29.034 --> 57:29.902
Just...

57:34.573 --> 57:36.608
because when I look at you sometimes,

57:39.578 --> 57:41.480
you feel similar to me.

57:53.292 --> 57:55.427
There is no one in this world
who has nothing to lose.

57:56.395 --> 57:58.764
Because those people were
someone's father and someone's mother too.

57:58.764 --> 58:00.532
Stop with the pathetic sob story.

58:02.434 --> 58:04.469
Who do you think you are
to talk to me like that?

58:04.469 --> 58:05.704
Are you saying I should've been ruined...

58:05.704 --> 58:07.940
because of people like them?

58:08.340 --> 58:09.141
I...

58:09.508 --> 58:11.276
am not like those people.

58:12.077 --> 58:14.479
I'm not one of those beastly types
who swarm like dogs...

58:14.479 --> 58:16.715
at the slightest opening
just to squeeze money out of people.

59:45.003 --> 59:47.005
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)

59:47.940 --> 59:52.678
(REVERSE)
